      <li id="src-3">The Bible, Leviticus 11:15; 1 Kings 17:4–6. (Public domain.) — biblical raven passages.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-claim-note"><strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> peer-reviewed/field-guide · <strong class="claim-lore">[lore]</strong> named cultural/historical source</p>
  </section>
